{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名どうり先日の生放送でメンバーの新モノマネをしましてその中の一人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山崎怜奈のモノマネ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださった方はわかると思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段彼女はリハの時とかでは、なるべく顔を出さない生活を送っておりまして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モノマネをしたときは、メンバーもちろん本人からも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「似てる似てる！私やってるかもー！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われ嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを見たことがない人に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"座って寝ていた ざきっちに動画を撮りながら小声で。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おはよーございます」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と起こしに行ったところ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例のざきっちをカメラで捉えることができました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一部始終をどうぞ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ているとこに、\n「おはよーございます」\nをまずしました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きた！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？あれ？でも顔どこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしてこれ正面じゃなくて後頭部かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや本当にそう思うくらい顔が髪の毛で隠れてて見つからない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えたよー！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきっち！！！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんわかりますか？この幅数センチしか出ていないお顔！\nわかりましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの楽しそうな私の顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのとき放送したようにザキさんの顔はいつも出てないのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきっちには前もってブログの内容と写真を説明したら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコニコしてどんなんですかーって言ってたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしといてな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってニコニコしちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきっちはきっといじられて喜ぶタイプなのだと確信しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログを見た後のざきっちがなんと言って来るか私は楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この寝起きのおはよーございますの動画"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は3期生のあの子もやられてるんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また話せる機会があればお伝えしますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の個別握手会の時のです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いにきてくださって ありがとうございました！！\n今回会えなかった方も次回会えるのを楽しみに待ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮るの忘れた！！！！って思ってたらコメント撮ってる時にマネージャーさんが撮っててくれました\nだからこれはコメント撮りしてる時の私です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"編みタイツに最近ちょっぴりハマってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽいでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早めの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったり\nテレビや雑誌のことやライブの話\nそして愛犬 ポテトの話し！などなど\n楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが楽しみです！\n是非是非来てくださる方、期待しててください！！\n最高のステージになるよう今、メンバー全員\n頑張っています！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこにこちゃーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/04/11/0089315/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}